    "tools_used": [
      "**Winner's Curse Analysis**: Calculate expected value vs. actual value won; identify if you're in a winner's curse situation",
      "**Anchoring Adjustments**: Identify reference points that might bias judgments; adjust estimates away from anchors",
      "**Mental Accounting Audit**: Track how you categorize spending/income; recognize arbitrary mental accounts",
      "**Framing Effects**: Examine how choices are presented; reframe to test stability of preferences",
      "**Overconfidence Calibration**: Track prediction accuracy; compare confidence intervals to actual outcomes",
      "**Planning Fallacy Mitigation**: Use reference class forecasting (compare to similar past projects) rather than inside view",
      "**Nudge Design**: Set optimal default options; design choice architecture to improve outcomes",
      "**Commitment Devices**: Pre-commit to future actions; use Ulysses contracts for self-control",
      "**Reference Point Analysis**: Identify reference points in decisions; test sensitivity to framing",
      "**Fairness Analysis**: Evaluate distributional consequences; consider social norms alongside efficiency",
      "**Opportunity Cost Calculation**: Explicitly consider alternatives to current choice",
      "**Marginal Thinking**: Evaluate decisions at the margin rather than sunk costs"
    ],
